{"id":20271,"imdb":"tt0055913","en":"Divorce Italian Style","orig":"Divorzio all'italiana","ar":null,"tag":"He ordered marriage on the rocks with a twist... Italian Style!","ov":"Ferdinando Cefalù is desperate to marry his cousin, Angela, but he is married to Rosalia and divorce is illegal in Italy. To get around the law, he tries to trick his wife into having an affair so he can catch her and murder her, as he knows he would be given a light sentence for killing an adulterous woman. He persuades a painter to lure his wife into an affair, but Rosalia proves to be more faithful than he expected.","rd":"1961-12-20","rt":104,"g":[35,80],"lang":"it","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Galatea Film","logo":null,"c":"IT"},{"n":"Lux Film","logo":null,"c":"IT"},{"n":"Vides Cinematografica","logo":null,"c":"IT"}],"countries":["IT"],"langs":["Italian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"IT","d":"1961-12-20"},{"c":"FR","d":"1962-05-19"},{"c":"US","d":"1962-09-17"},{"c":"RO","d":"1963-02-01"},{"c":"SU","d":"1964-07-06"},{"c":"NL","d":"2010-09-09"}],"dir":["Pietro Germi"],"prod":["Franco Cristaldi"],"wri":["Ennio De Concini","Pietro Germi","Alfredo Giannetti"],"mus":["Carlo Rustichelli"],"dop":["Leonida Barboni","Carlo Di Palma"],"cast":[{"n":"Marcello Mastroianni","ch":"Ferdinando Cefalù","p":"/bfLnFfNfMC73Q7WW90xQy2PvRZm.jpg"},{"n":"Daniela Rocca","ch":"Rosalia Cefalù","p":"/vThV4vilYjWLu9Wj5uuqcM4BOXa.jpg"},{"n":"Stefania Sandrelli","ch":"Angela","p":"/FgC2JtlrNTMs0nCs6C6BADg7lb.jpg"},{"n":"Leopoldo Trieste","ch":"Carmelo Patanè","p":"/rPvCj39OY7LClFh9CG2OXFKxioB.jpg"},{"n":"Odoardo Spadaro","ch":"Don Gaetano Cefalù","p":"/s4OAW7BvKcQtYmZf5Oej78FYEcP.jpg"},{"n":"Margherita Girelli","ch":"Sisina","p":null},{"n":"Angela Cardile","ch":"Agnese Cefalù","p":null},{"n":"Lando Buzzanca","ch":"Rosario Mulè","p":"/uQ7nJZtcsFkKxti2JVZOizgQSoH.jpg"},{"n":"Pietro Tordi","ch":"Attorney De Marzi","p":"/kIpvNHHea2rPIUCoiNy9g8UpK3e.jpg"},{"n":"Ugo Torrente","ch":"Don Calogero","p":null},{"n":"Anto